# HANDOFF.md was previously listed here and is now TRACKED ON PURPOSE (2026-08-18).
# Decision: the continuity notes are worth more as a recoverable artifact than as a
# local-only file — a wholesale rewrite had already destroyed several sections once,
# with no git copy to restore them from.
# Consequence, stated so it is not rediscovered by accident: this repo is PUBLIC, so
# HANDOFF.md's contents are public too — including the mentor's quoted emails, the
# Overleaf project link, and local filesystem paths. That was a considered choice, not
# an oversight. Do not paste anything into HANDOFF.md you would not publish.

# NOTE: results/ — including results/params/*.jld parameter snapshots — IS
